Generator provenance
--------------------
The initial aircraft, engine, propeller and control-system configurations were
generated using Aeromatic++ 3.3.21 from JSBSim v1.3.1, developed by the JSBSim
project contributors. Existing generator attribution is retained in the files.
https://github.com/JSBSim-Team/jsbsim/tree/v1.3.1/utils/aeromatic%2B%2B

Aircraft data references are recorded in docs/SOURCES.md.
Subsequent project contributions are recorded in Git history. Add the authors
and applicable license notices of imported components or assets when introduced.

